{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_title", "source_sha256": "50f502711122d3f7388fd08d0e8f0eed0f169f317aed994f6039b3276e488988", "ja": "ライブMC　～伝わる気持ち～", "zh": "演唱会MC ～传达的心意～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_synopsis", "source_sha256": "32c9e5306230e96bac83b6c3321445626f1e76f1e09565def32e872b4541e43f", "ja": "MCにて、今の楽しすぎる気持ちを独特の言\n葉で表現する未来。すぐにその意図を理解す\nる春香に、驚く静香と翼。歌も言葉も、心を\nこめたらきっと伝わる……春香の言葉に、最\n後まで気持ちを伝えようと決意する一同。", "zh": "在主持环节中，未来用独特的话语表达着\n此刻无比开心的心情。对于瞬间理解其意图\n的春香，静香和翼都感到很惊讶。无论是歌\n声还是话语，只要倾注心意就一定能传达出\n去……听了春香的话，大家下定决心，要将\n这份心意传达至最后一刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "cc991403e713f272086b8396d7af0bb333ec26055a16c2593601a66a02c92e40", "ja": "ライブも、いよいよ大詰めです！\nみなさん、最後まで盛り上がりましょうね！", "zh": "演出也终于进入尾声了！\n大家一起嗨到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1001_se", "source_sha256": "e4c1f3bad61b7d4f4e1b97f0f625270bb2df9548604383db46f80b8114472513", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "73040074f547f47291ebe99ce0193917384099761d8eddcfa86b3f7af7912209", "ja": "みんな、まだまだ元気いっぱいですね！\nわたしだって、負けないんだから！　ね、未来？", "zh": "大家还是充满活力呢！\n我也不会输的！对吧，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "eae8ce8c81f34a7fa718c33d67d974b6215f0b1ad98e247a9042a3bc0130f18f", "ja": "うん！　とーっても楽しすぎて……なんだろう？\nお母さんが毎日、大好物を作ってくれてるみたい！", "zh": "嗯！开心得不得了……该怎么说呢？\n就像妈妈每天都在做我最喜欢吃的东西一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "e200967e714e62157a5fd9694d721cfe21afb30a04027800183b331beb7bc461", "ja": "うんうん！　すっごくよくわかるよ、未来ちゃん。\n私も、いま同じ気持ちだもん！", "zh": "嗯嗯！我特别能理解你，未来。\n我现在也是同样的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "180ddd8654c54a226f1818c742bf069d2e9ae32d30cd23b95e8f13d68138dfbb", "ja": "春香さん……今の未来の言葉、わかったんですか？\nいえ、私もわかりますけど……なんとなくなら。", "zh": "春香小姐……您听懂未来刚才说的话了吗？\n不，我也能听懂……大概能懂吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "858f11481c25352b9ff4c2e1a0383160411daa83a632b3c34eed5ce40daaa768", "ja": "さっすが、春香さん！　未来の言うことわかるのって、\nいつも遊んでるわたしたちくらいかと思ってた～。", "zh": "不愧是春香前辈！我还以为能听懂未来说的话的，只有我们这些平时总在一起玩的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "de6e1dc8331d202b7213eb86c960ab6e4d71b689912567ec18dc4d297d3f699d", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　えっとね。歌も言葉も、同じで……\n心をこめたら、きっと相手に伝わると思うんだ。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？呃，歌声和话语，其实是一样的……\n只要倾注真心，我想一定能传达给对方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "ecc57b6266e403bf17f786d12b9c1f12fb89ce783285db04ae1bddfeae897f3d", "ja": "だからかな？　未来ちゃんが、ファンのみんなのことを\n家族みたいに大切に思ってることとか……。", "zh": "所以才会这样吗？比如未来把每一位粉丝都像家人一样珍视……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "4ccd3e7fc426afd3fe5b6ff17086f308a024b54a2bb868949b213d3ad6b3c1d8", "ja": "どの曲も全力でパフォーマンスして……大好きな物を\n食べた後みたいに、胸がいっぱいなんだな……とか！", "zh": "每首歌都全力表演……就好像吃完最喜欢的东西一样，心里满满的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "68e412447809979f8671148f63fda6b62b8468a7bfd2ca398d9a5700b58ae14c", "ja": "春香さん……！　そうなんです！\n私、そういうことが言いたかったんですっ！", "zh": "春香小姐……！就是这样！\n我就是想说这个来着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "79b9ba7bf0d87befe8641b30cb0d3b303c2b664a78df5f3fe1f1d90493800758", "ja": "みなさーん！！\nそんな私たちの気持ち、伝わってますか～！？", "zh": "大家——！！\n我们这样的心情，有传达给你们吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1014_se", "source_sha256": "9126a049045b2b3bc43e0a83492d107cbdfda899286c15f99debc21704dad016", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "4efbada8a543a7dcdd7fdaa9c050c3d9799a3bff42adb1de14c59ed37bae5910", "ja": "静香ちゃん、翼……今の声、聞いた？\nファンのみんなに伝わってるって！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "静香、翼……你们听到刚才的声音了吗？\n这下大家的声音都传到粉丝们那里了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "cc7d6a692eb2f9e99ef03d4ffb95f4ffe3406e1441707b7ebb8a7152d51e51c7", "ja": "ふふ……よかったわね、未来！　でも、気を抜いちゃ\nダメよ。最後の最後まで、記念公演は続くんだから！", "zh": "呵呵……太好了呢，未来！不过，可不能掉以轻心哦。纪念公演会一直持续到最后一刻的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "d282c9a8a6e53a9d450f29814d8e0065a108f6dac9dce22ecd37276ecca6ffc0", "ja": "わかってるよ！　私、『ありがとう』とか、『これから\nもよろしく』って、まだまだ伝え足りないもん！", "zh": "我知道啦！我还没把“谢谢”以及“今后也请多多关照”这些话，充分传达给大家呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_13_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "71a9be9c62235c740cc51616f43d492ce7d5d059827f5785dd5427823b04f365", "ja": "うん♪　最後まで、わたしたちの気持ち、届けようね！\nみんなも、ちゃーんと受け取ってくださいね♪", "zh": "嗯♪ 一直到最后，也要把我们的心意传达出去哦！\n大家也要好好接收哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
